# caption: Account for roots and obsolete references across a thunk update.

REQUIRE runtime GC protocol, active update target, result closure/value
ENSURE no live reference is lost and obsolete captures are not retained unnecessarily
keep update target and evaluation continuation visible as roots
publish the result through the runtime's required write barrier
change thunk state consistently with result visibility
remove obsolete expression and environment references
retire update-frame roots only after publication is complete

